  m_text: "<u><b><size=+8>Development Team</size></b></u>\r\nJerry Volcy, Ph.D.,
    SpelmanXR\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Lead</color></size>\r\n\r\nTBD\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>tbd</color></size>\r\n\r\n<u><b><size=+8>Voice
    Actors</size></b></u>\r\nMariama Barry, Spelman College Class of ???\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Girlfriend</color></size>\r\n\r\nGeanna
    Gwinn, Spelman College Class of 2025\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Player Internal
    Voice</color></size>\r\n\r\n<b><size=+8>Consultants</size></b>\r\nTBD\r\n\r\n<u><b><size=+8>Sound
    FX</size></b></u>\r\nCapsLok\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Squeaky Wooden Door</color></size>\r\n<size=-8>https://freesound.org/s/181259/</size>\r\n\r\nCraigsmith\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Fight/Fall
    Sound</color></size>\r\n<size=-8>https://freesound.org/s/675925/</size>\r\n\r\nRoughCoast\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Woman
    Screaming</color></size>\r\n<size=-8>https://www.pond5.com/sound-effects/item/238459689-woman-screaming-and-crying-no-horror-movie-sound-effect</size>\r\n\r\nAderuMoro\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Terrified
    Screams</color></size>\r\n<size=-8>https://freesound.org/s/264918/</size>\r\n\r\nBulbastre\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Ambient
    Dorm Sound</color></size>\r\n<size=-8>https://freesound.org/s/126927/</size>\r\n\r\nArnaud
    Coutancier\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Night Sound</color></size>\r\n<size=-8>https://freesound.org/s/456986/</size>\r\n\r\nVR\r\n<size=-4><color=#DDDDBB>Magic
    Sound FX</color></size>\r\n<size=-8>https://freesound.org/s/349465/</size>\r\n\r\n\r\n<u><b><size=+8>3D
    Assets</size></b></u>\r\n[Campus]\r\nLowpoly British School Building - by Gabriel
    Quintana\r\nhttps://www.fab.com/listings/fa1b793d-5432-46d0-80a1-7a07497dee2d?quickBuyOfferId=859345e5a7c44778844558f76bbcd575\r\n\r\n[Hallway]\r\nhttps://sketchfab.com/3d-models/building-hallway-b407c0f316b94b1cbcf0bf254c3c2442\r\n\"Building
    Hallway\" (https://skfb.ly/oqAQJ) by jimbogies is licensed under Creative Commons
    Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n[Dorm Room]\r\nhttps://sketchfab.com/3d-models/warm-dorm-room-b387c759822241fb966d0d573455cbd3\r\n\"Warm
    Dorm Room\" (https://skfb.ly/oxpqr) by darylsteak is licensed under Creative
    Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n[Direction
    Arrows]\r\nhttps://sketchfab.com/3d-models/direction-arrow-6ef46718c7b242e39fcad7f27ee858a5#download\r\n\"Direction
    Arrow\" (https://skfb.ly/ozHGW) by Alihan is licensed under Creative Commons
    Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n[Digital Clock]\r\nhttps://sketchfab.com/3d-models/digital-clock-456fc79850774ceb81727dcc76de7808#download\r\n\"Digital_Clock\"
    (https://skfb.ly/oNsIN) by .Krissami. is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution
    (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n[Picture Frame (No Men
    Allowed Signs)]\r\nhttps://sketchfab.com/3d-models/picture-frame-db449a93609a40c3a5ea26b330b0b3b6\r\n\"Picture
    Frame\" by suryajayabudimulia is License under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n[Lamp]\r\n\"Table
    Lamp\" (https://skfb.ly/oANpU) by M. Zamzam is licensed under Creative Commons
    Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n[Campus Shrubs]\r\n\"Stylized
    Bush\" (https://skfb.ly/oTDpD) by Daniel is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution
    (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n[Low Poly Trees]\r\n\"Trees
    Low Poly\" (https://skfb.ly/6YpAS) by Igor_K. is licensed under Creative Commons
    Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n[Night Skybox]\r\n10
    Skyboxes Pack : Day - Night by Wello Soft\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/2d/textures-materials/sky/10-skyboxes-pack-day-night-32236\r\n\r\n[Building
    Sign Light]\r\n\"Wall Light\" (https://skfb.ly/oPWBY) by Blizzy is licensed under
    Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n[Silhouette
    of female hand]\r\n\"Silhouette of female hand isolated on a white background\"
    by Nobilior \r\nhttps://www.alamy.com/silhouette-of-female-hand-isolated-on-a-white-background-image184649914.html\r\n\r\n\r\n<u><b><size=+8>Fonts</size></b></u>\r\n[Digital
    Clock Fonts]\r\nBy: Style-7\r\nhttps://www.1001fonts.com/digital-7-font.html\r\nSizenko
    Alexander\r\nhttp://www.styleseven.com\r\nCreated: October 7 2008\r\n\r\n[Cavolini
    Font]\r\nby Carl Crossgrove - https://www.cufonfonts.com/font/cavolini\r\n\r\n[MMM
    Dispenser Font]\r\nBorel Font\r\nhttps://fonts.google.com/specimen/Borel\r\nThe
    Borel Project Authors (https://github.com/RosaWagner/Borel)\r\n\r"
